  "notes": [
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-submit-0000001158245061#section41670133",
      "text": "此接口用于提交应用审核，调用本接口前必须保证应用信息已补充完整，应用软件包已经上传。接口调用者的角色：账号持有者、管理员、APP管理员。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-submit-0000001158245061#section41670133",
      "text": "软件包采用异步解析方式，请您在传包后等候2分钟再调用提交发布接口。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-submit-0000001158245061#section236517415165",
      "text": "API客户端方式和OAuth客户端方式的区别请参见使用入门。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-submit-0000001158245061#section236517415165",
      "text": "API客户端方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-submit-0000001158245061#section236517415165",
      "text": "OAuth客户端方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-submit-0000001158245061#section11431111271820",
      "text": "当releaseType为3时，请求Body中phasedReleaseStartTime，phasedReleaseEndTime，phasedReleaseDescription必填，其他情况不用填写。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-submit-0000001158245061#section11431111271820",
      "text": "Body中使用JSON格式携带发布信息，参数如下表所示。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Postman调试",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-submit-0000001158245061#section125219373498",
      "text": "您可以使用Postman在线调试此接口。"
    }
